<title>USA: VimpelCom subscribers rise.</title>
<headline>VimpelCom subscribers rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vimpel Communications said Friday that as of March 31, 1997, it had over 64,500 subscribers in the Moscow area, 119 percent more than the 29,400 subscribers it had a year earler.</p>
<p>VimpelCom reported first quarter earnings of $0.87 a share ($0.65 per ADS), compared to $0.38 a share ($0.29 per ADS) the previous first quarter.</p>
</text>
